        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "embroidered net, 1800s, Persian"@en , "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk with an added silk fringe.\nHand-made red silk net.  On four sides there is a narrow border with an inscription in white Kufic reading 'Ya Ali'.  There is a zigzag line in white on either side. The central field has a small square grid in white."@en ;
